WEBVTT

00:00:12.634 --> 00:00:15.967
<v><b>Host:</b></v> Good evening. Welcome to <i>Quiz Night</i>.

00:00:16.458 --> 00:00:20.799
Our first contestant is Eddie from Washington, D.C.

00:00:23.729 --> 00:00:26.440
Hi, Eddie. Are you nervous?

00:00:26.724 --> 00:00:28.810
<v><b>Eddie:</b></v> No, not really.

00:00:28.835 --> 00:00:32.347
I think I’m, uh, ready.

00:00:32.726 --> 00:00:34.562
<v><b>Host:</b></v> Well, let’s hope so.

00:00:35.116 --> 00:00:37.552
The rules are the same as always.

00:00:37.819 --> 00:00:42.941
I’m going to read you some sentences, and you have ten seconds to say

00:00:42.966 --> 00:00:45.709
if the sentence is true or false.

00:00:46.296 --> 00:00:51.178
If you get the first answer right, you win one hundred dollars.

00:00:51.455 --> 00:00:55.737
Then for each correct answer, you double your money,

00:00:56.119 --> 00:01:01.125
so if you get the second answer right, you win two hundred dollars,

00:01:01.388 --> 00:01:06.324
and for the third correct answer, you win four hundred dollars.

00:01:07.049 --> 00:01:13.535
For eight correct answers, you win twelve thousand eight hundred dollars.

00:01:16.638 --> 00:01:20.977
But if you get an answer wrong, you lose all the money.

00:01:23.724 --> 00:01:30.507
Remember, you can also call a friend, so if you’re not sure about one of the answers,

00:01:30.573 --> 00:01:33.466
you can call your friend to help you.

00:01:33.985 --> 00:01:35.653
Is that OK, Eddie?

00:01:36.182 --> 00:01:37.700
<v><b>Eddie:</b></v> Yeah, OK.